.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-04-25T11:40:48Z","updated_at":"2023-04-25T11:40:48Z","body":"I'm +1 to add this to the list, as a simple, historical license which appears to be broadly permissive / meet the OSI definition.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what to use for the name and identifier. I'm inclined not to use \"one-para\" or \"One Paragraph\" since there are likely other man pages that also have just one paragraph. But I take your point about VERBATIM_ONE_PARA being the tag used at https://github.com/mkerrisk/man-pages/blob/ae6b221882ce71ba82fcdbe02419a225111502f0/man2/getcpu.2#L3. Open to others' thoughts on this as well!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1521644294/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1548938419","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1955#issuecomment-1548938419","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1955","id":1548938419,"